  "bio": "Luis Mauricio is a highly skilled tattoo artist known for his specialization in lettering and vegan-style tattooing. He operates at 'La Nave Tattoo' where he uses only vegan and cruelty-free products, demonstrating his deep commitment to ethical standards. His work encapsulates the enigmatic phrase, 'Created in the Abyss,' showing his willingness to explore unknown territories within his chosen art form.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location:\n\nI offer fantasy 🦇 \nSantiago de Chile 🌃\nTatuajes coloridos ✨\nExperiencia y dedicación al tatuaje 🌿",
